      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible to keep the oldest port? Without this plugging in your phone to C0 would make your SSD stop working on C1.\n\nThis is a \u0027should\u0027 in the compatibility spec, but I could see the \u0027lowest number\u0027 being a frustrating policy for users.",
