      "writtenOn": "2021-01-06T23:15:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is true but they seem to normally ask for 3A regardless of what they actually need.\n\nAny chance to use the capabilities mismatch bit? The spirit of the tbt3 power distribution was to prioritize tbt3 device over, say, charging your phone. I haven\u0027t done my homework on what that would entail or how the SNK implementation of that bit is looking.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 159,
